    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chesstris combines chess pieces and Tetris controls into 100+ handcrafted puzzles. Puzzle Architects will present you with different chess positions and give pieces that you need to use to checkmate the rival kings without checkmating your own.    <br>  <br>Can you beat all their puzzles and uncover the truth behind the long lost friendships?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/4a6923f3c6d2056085d447c8ff0da886.poster.avif?t=1751123502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/4a6923f3c6d2056085d447c8ff0da886.webm?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/4a6923f3c6d2056085d447c8ff0da886.mp4?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different puzzle architects, each with their own puzzle gimmicks.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/c686a40b2d96520b7414449d1a10a42a.poster.avif?t=1751123502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/c686a40b2d96520b7414449d1a10a42a.webm?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/c686a40b2d96520b7414449d1a10a42a.mp4?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover reasons behind discontinued friendships. Will you mend them or ruin forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/6b8e356630f54123467c106f2ab4c423.poster.avif?t=1751123502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/6b8e356630f54123467c106f2ab4c423.webm?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/6b8e356630f54123467c106f2ab4c423.mp4?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse the interactive puzzle map and try to uncover its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/c5aea2f82f7eacd7d06b2c6e0af27af6.poster.avif?t=1751123502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/c5aea2f82f7eacd7d06b2c6e0af27af6.webm?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/c5aea2f82f7eacd7d06b2c6e0af27af6.mp4?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Utilize given tools to overcome the hardest puzzles.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/7c728e8802dffef13246e5e20efd5061.poster.avif?t=1751123502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/7c728e8802dffef13246e5e20efd5061.webm?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/7c728e8802dffef13246e5e20efd5061.mp4?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Encyclopedia to learn about Chess and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/e4aeae24474c8ded5361a8dd46875019.poster.avif?t=1751123502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/e4aeae24474c8ded5361a8dd46875019.webm?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/e4aeae24474c8ded5361a8dd46875019.mp4?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Interactive Story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secret puzzles that will open depending on your choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Romance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ handcrafted puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own puzzles.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adjust the colors to make them more pleasant for you.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accessibility options for adjusting difficulty to suit your play style.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chesstris combines chess pieces and Tetris controls into 100+ handcrafted puzzles. Puzzle Architects will present you with different chess positions and give pieces that you need to use to checkmate the rival kings without checkmating your own.    <br>  <br>Can you beat all their puzzles and uncover the truth behind the long lost friendships?<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/4a6923f3c6d2056085d447c8ff0da886.poster.avif?t=1751123502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/4a6923f3c6d2056085d447c8ff0da886.webm?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/4a6923f3c6d2056085d447c8ff0da886.mp4?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet different puzzle architects, each with their own puzzle gimmicks.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/c686a40b2d96520b7414449d1a10a42a.poster.avif?t=1751123502\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/c686a40b2d96520b7414449d1a10a42a.webm?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3339000/extras/c686a40b2d96520b7414449d1a10a42a.mp4?t=1751123502\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover reasons behind discontinued friendships. Will you mend them or ruin forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=